<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts telecom sector.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts telecom sector.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Friday analyst Richard Klugman had started coverage of the telecommunications sector.</p>
<p>-- Klugman rated Sprint Corp and GTE Corp market outperformers.</p>
<p>-- He put LCI International Inc, Pacific Gateway Exchange Inc and WorldCom Inc on the firm's recommended list.  </p>
<p>-- He rated Ameritech Corp, Bell Atlantic Corp, BellSouth Corp, SBC Communications Inc, AT&amp;T Corp and U S West Communications Group as market performers.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
